# SPEC-03 — Lighting and shading

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-03-lighting-shading.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

Relight is IC-Light. Intensity and colour temperature currently collapse to prompt words. Honest UI means real numeric params or a coarse control, not a fine slider over three buckets. Bloom and vignette strength are single export filters.
